    "UIName": "Pegasus PG-2R",
    "Id": "vehicledef_PEGASUS_3058",
    "Name": "Pegasus PG-2R",
    "Details": "After the Truce of Tukayyid, the DCMS began an upgrade of the Pegasus hovertank. The new model, produced by Scarborough Manufacturers of Al Na'ir, replaces the ICE with a 140-rated fusion engine. This gives the new Pegasus a faster speed of 151.2 km/h. The medium laser with a pulse model. It also adds a new Guardian ECM, a TAG, and a Beagle probe. The Pegasus is a popular recon unit, due to its good speed, decent armor, and respectable firepower. It can be found in almost all militaries, having been introduced in the First Succession War and continuously updated ever since.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 9/14 hexes / 270/420 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       120     20\n<b>Left</b>          80     20\n<b>Right</b>        80     20\n<b>Rear</b>         55     20\n<b>Turret</b>      100     20\n\n<b>Total</b>      435    100</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Improved Communications</color>",
    "Icon": "Pegasus"
  },
